    {
      "selector": ".sqs-html-content (index 0)",
      "html": "<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Vudi Phothisuk is a multidisciplinary artist exploring the emotional depth of landscape, memory, and design. His work blends texture, color, and collaboration to create timeless pieces that feel both ancient and current. Each collection invites a pause — a moment to reflect on beauty, presence, and the quiet weight of experience</p></div>",
      "text": "Vudi Phothisuk is a multidisciplinary artist exploring the emotional depth of landscape, memory, and design. His work blends texture, color, and collaboration to create timeless pieces that feel both ancient and current. Each collection invites a pause — a moment to reflect on beauty, presence, and the quiet weight of experience"
    }
  ],
